Z||000008||jerpro||01-06-2001||03:41 PM||||that's the great thing about the msd timing control. You can buy it for around 150 bucks and trust me for the duke, there is no better bang-for-the-buck preformence.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000009||Racer 1||01-07-2001||01:17 AM||||I polished my TBI unit inside and installed the 160 termostat and hooker super comp tri-Y header. Got rid of the muffler and put a 10" straight thru muffler deal on. I can do 30 MPH in first gear then it almost redlines 4800 rpm. Starts arent to bad my fiero goes alittle sideways for about 15 feet. But get rid of the muffler asap.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://spitfire.cwv.net/~cdbailey/images/gifssucl/eyes2/evil_eyes.gif"> ||||reg||10
