Z||000011||fotofrank||01-07-2001||03:59 PM|||| I got the MSD 6A on e-bay for $100.00 and the Holley TBI from a wrecked car for $90.00.<BR>To buy this stuff outright is a lot o'bucks. MSD 6A about $130.00 new and a new Holley TB is about $300.00. I also have a 180deg therostate and an MSD GM Blaster coil.Therostate about $6.00 and the coil $50.00. The 2.6 muffler came from e-bay for less the $50.00. Just add one pice at a time and before you know your lil' ol' Duke will fly.See my web page (listed below)<P>------------------<BR>Peace and Happiness<BR>Frank and his fotoflash, an '84 SE 2M4<BR>http://fotofrank.homestead.com/foto1~ns4.html||||reg||12
